    {
      "id": "text-32",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 624,
      "y": 177,
      "width": 481.609375,
      "height": 118.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#202124",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "seed": 2018153688,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1844116330,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“O username controlado pelo cliente é interpolado\ndiretamente na consulta SQL executada por cur.execute.\nUm atacante que alcance sqlivuln pode alterar a cláusula\nWHERE e usar construções SQL, como UNION, para\nconsultar dados adicionais do banco.”",
      "originalText": "“O username controlado pelo cliente é interpolado\ndiretamente na consulta SQL executada por cur.execute.\nUm atacante que alcance sqlivuln pode alterar a cláusula\nWHERE e usar construções SQL, como UNION, para\nconsultar dados adicionais do banco.”",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "text-33",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 624,
      "y": 313.75,
      "width": 133.08203125,
      "height": 23.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1967D2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "seed": 1018118710,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1374766159,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Recomendação",
      "originalText": "Recomendação",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "text-34",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 624,
      "y": 343.75,
      "width": 437.05078125,
      "height": 95.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#202124",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "seed": 2139594177,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1288367190,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“Usar consulta parametrizada, por exemplo,\ncur.execute(\"SELECT * FROM USERS WHERE\nUSERNAME=?\", (username,)), sem interpolação de\nentrada.”",
      "originalText": "“Usar consulta parametrizada, por exemplo,\ncur.execute(\"SELECT * FROM USERS WHERE\nUSERNAME=?\", (username,)), sem interpolação de\nentrada.”",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 89
    },
